WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.899
The headline numbers: scale-invariant FID of
sixty-one at four-times and one twenty-one at eight-times,

00:00:06.979 --> 00:00:09.338
both beating the strongest baseline.

00:00:09.418 --> 00:00:11.845
Over ninety percent human preference.

00:00:11.925 --> 00:00:16.656
Up to seven point two times faster inference
through parallel batching,

00:00:16.736 --> 00:00:22.686
cutting eight-thousand-pixel synthesis from one
hundred thirty-seven seconds to nineteen.

00:00:22.766 --> 00:00:25.328
Paired with In-and-Out for outpainting,

00:00:25.408 --> 00:00:31.020
FID drops to nine on Places365 and fifteen on
Flickr-Scenery, halving previous best.
